; ── Mei · Blood Witch ──────────────────────────────────────────────
; Battle focus: Red-color assault  +  Crimson Night (ATK x2)  +  Four-color combo

@stopBgm
@bgm intense
@back bg03 time:0.3
@char 魅兒 pos:50 time:0

魅兒.rage: You're challenging me? If you dare — Blood Curse!

@choice "Challenge accepted!"
@stop

魅兒.talking: Hmph. Don't underestimate blood magic — I can make you regret this with my own blood.
魅兒.idle: But... if you can knock me down, I'll admit you've got some real skill.

@hide 魅兒
@set RuneActive=true
@battle background:bg03 target:monster01 scriptName:demo_mei label:afterbattle
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# afterbattle
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm sad
@back bg03 time:0.3
@char 魅兒 pos:50 time:0

魅兒.idle: ...Fine. You've earned it.
魅兒.talking: Go grab a new rune. Blood magic rewards those who push through.

@hide 魅兒
@GotoChangeRune scriptName:demo label:aftermap
@stop
